{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unserious Sandbox is a single-player casual game with some unserious parkour, just the player's movement, traversing abstract worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/Unserious_Sandbox.jpg?t=1749448322\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traversal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are two traversal modes: <strong>Parkour</strong> and <strong>Traverse</strong>. <i>Parkour</i> enables strafing, whereas <i>Traverse</i> allows wall-running. In both modes, traversal moves are picked dynamically based on movement trajectory upon traversal attempt. In both modes, the goal is the same: Set your own record, then challenge it. Smooth traversal is all about pace and timing. It may look easy, but it's not. Feel the momentum, and find your own flow.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/UnseriousSandbox64-bitDevelopmentPCD3D_SM62025-05-3017-36-30-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749448322\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Ragdoll Physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On-demand ragdoll physics simulation in sandbox maps. Embrace the chaos and master the art of falling flat!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/UnseriousSandbox64-bitDevelopmentPCD3D_SM62025-05-3016-41-27-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749448322\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beyond Sandbox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unserious Sandbox is a toy box, collecting fragments from other worlds. It may be empty right now, but surely, one day it'll fill. Do whatever, play however... The Sandbox is just unserious, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3391340/extras/redmaple.png?t=1749448322\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","b